radxa-penta-top-hat-rs (1.0.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Keep fan control available when the optional OLED device is missing.
  * Recognize a long press following a click and preserve edges at click expiry.
  * Reject invalid and overflowing timer values before hardware initialization.

