radxa-penta-top-hat-rs (1.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Preserve recent drive temperatures across transient SMART polling failures.
  * Use maximum fan duty when configured drive telemetry remains unavailable.
  * Reject unknown configuration sections, keys, and button actions.
  * Add GitHub Actions CI and automatic release publishing for version bumps.

 -- Vathivis <vojtahumpl@seznam.cz>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 11:10:56 +0200

